: Derived from a real delegated turn ("find the deseq2 paper", 2026-07-30) — see
: docs/desktop-app-plan.md §15. Reduced so it can live in the repo: middleware
: `updates` dropped, chunk/metadata narrowed to the fields any client reads,
: consecutive single-token text frames coalesced, tool results and `values`
: transcripts truncated. Every `tool_call_chunks` fragment is verbatim, because that
: is where the decoder's only stateful logic lives.

